{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#feature-1", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的功能「屏幕视觉问答」：截取当前屏幕并交给配置的视觉模型回答问题；默认还会附加 uiautomator 文本和边界信息。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:238-260"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#feature-2", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的功能「触屏操作」：通过坐标点击或按起止坐标滑动屏幕，用于逐步操作 Android 界面。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:265-284"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#feature-3", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的功能「文本输入」：将 ASCII 文本输入当前焦点；非 ASCII 和控制字符会返回提示。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:287-305"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#feature-4", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的功能「按键与页面导航」：发送常用硬件键，或通过 Android Intent 打开系统或应用页面，可提供 URI 和组件。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:307-365"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#feature-5", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的功能「截图保存」：将当前手机截图保存到配置的目录并返回文件路径。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:103-107"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#caveat-1", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 使用内置视觉模式时，会把屏幕截图和问题发送到配置的视觉模型端点；也可配置本地兼容端点或 MCP 视觉服务。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:110-136", "server.py:139-200"]}
{"unit_id": "boheastill__phone-eye#caveat-2", "repo": "boheastill/phone-eye", "commit": "932b969efbbecbe76882f58109da32a29e4e4ee1", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "Phone-Eye 的文本输入只支持 ASCII；中文等非 ASCII 输入会被拒绝，代码建议改用设备剪贴板方式。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["server.py:287-305"]}
